      "chunk_text": "Customer Sneha Roy called insurance agent Karan Joshi regarding a status error on her home policy (HP-001234), which erroneously showed as expired despite her having renewed it. The agent investigated, explained that it was a system delay requiring a technical update, assured her that the policy is active and covered, and promised to send a confirmation email and follow up with IT.",
